        "type": "writing",
        "title": "The table shows the number of employees and factories producing silk in England and Wales between 1851 and 1901. Summarise the information by selecting, reporting the main features, and make comparison where relevant.",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-JIAydXBCkoYLqCxrZyDl7wb4gYe\"><em><strong>The table shows the number of employees and factories producing silk in England and Wales between 1851 and 1901. Summarise the information by selecting, reporting the main features, and make comparison where relevant.</strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - Silk Industry in England &amp; Wales: 1851&ndash;1901</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> Idea cho Overview:</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0nNdqrxtoU9EGxkGvml6QHzgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QxWPdDnfdod2NixZJAjlLYzqgGb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QEeEdHIN4ofkwNxCkILl0889gfh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-F5xEdvXIaowy0GxL2a2lB2jfgid\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SjmOdwvzzowAdLxFQUElrTUagrd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EpMydNSxHocPpcx8hb8lhqnrg1c\">\n<div>\n<div>Trong đề Silk Industry in England &amp; Wales: 1851&ndash;1901 n&agrave;y,&nbsp;<strong>team academic IELTS 1984</strong> chọn c&aacute;c điểm nổi bật dựa tr&ecirc;n <strong>trend</strong> (xu hướng) v&agrave; <strong>differences</strong> (sự kh&aacute;c biệt) của dữ liệu để cho v&agrave;o Overview.</div>\n<div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SsIidp3lgorUOmxRaINlv8qNgkd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Trend: </strong>Lực lượng lao động trong ng&agrave;nh c&ocirc;ng nghiệp tơ lụa giảm đều cho cả hai giới t&iacute;nh, số lượng nh&agrave; m&aacute;y d&ugrave; c&oacute; tăng mạnh ở đầu k&igrave;, tuy nhi&ecirc;n giảm đều sau đ&oacute;</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HeKBdvxPNoyn5NxlNBPlYBpTgUg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Differences:</strong> Ng&agrave;nh n&agrave;y c&oacute; nhiều c&ocirc;ng nh&acirc;n nữ hơn l&agrave; nam</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QxWPdDnfdod2NixZJAjlLYzqgGb\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> C&aacute;ch ph&acirc;n chia BODY:</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DQntd3hjzoNCjwxOfz4lvHOcgbb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N9LhdhEVXoJnGNxJPvyl0YZPg9e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-KGfkdvXnMo9tBVxWubvlf0gagVh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TOoQd6oJTo25Hhxi84tlE4FPgnb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XibGdxfRGovZX4xmloNlYRnWgNh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-F2aHdRosAoJyFhxEEwSlHZ0cgsb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N3jndS9QIoiqpVxn5XOlqWIkgic\">\n<div>\n<div>Ở b&agrave;i Silk Industry in England &amp; Wales: 1851&ndash;1901 ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh ph&acirc;n BODY theo số c&ocirc;ng nh&acirc;n v&agrave; số nh&agrave; m&aacute;y:</div>\n<div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-W4SqdeBSDobGasxeiHflD1ywgDb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>BODY 1:</strong> Xu hướng của<strong> </strong>tổng số c&ocirc;ng nh&acirc;n, so s&aacute;nh tương đồng trong xu hướng số c&ocirc;ng nh&acirc;n nam v&agrave; nữ</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EcspdprG6oCgd3x7ktElfr36gnf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>BODY 2: </strong>Xu hướng của số nh&agrave; m&aacute;y dệt</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> C&aacute;ch viết từng c&acirc;u:</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WTQ0dwsgtot3Mux4ZXOl05hSgTH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AmqcddMWAotWQFxJT6xl8CElghf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RKcrd7u17ogCsex6cUPlJ2cCgkh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WmZmdTBuno2TMIx2y6zl9EQGgRd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NcOkdRMB3oglFQx3YSslSvXpgbe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VzPUdBpFmosYQyx4NFOl79YRgKh\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-APeudfcnGokeKfxzDvQl1ZTYg0b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FLrHdc701owzfzxHR4Al2Nq3ggc\">\n<div data-lark-html-role=\"root\"><span class=\"text-only\" data-eleid=\"10\">Theo </span><strong><span class=\"text-only\" data-eleid=\"11\">Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></span></strong><span class=\"text-only\" data-eleid=\"12\">, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng như sau:</span></div>\n<div data-lark-html-role=\"root\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PaNsdg4aJoiIzmxn90MlYcMmgph\">\n<div>\n<h4><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1: Tổng số c&ocirc;ng nh&acirc;n - Số lượng c&ocirc;ng nh&acirc;n nam v&agrave; nữ </strong></span></h4>\n<div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VuPDdh5Coo5Wnpx4HXflePH1gje\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 1:</strong> V&agrave;o năm 1851,<strong> tổng lực lượng lao động (total employees)</strong> trong ng&agrave;nh tơ lụa đạt mức cao nhất với gần 131,000 người, trong số n&agrave;y c&oacute; 54,000<strong> lao động nam</strong> v&agrave; 77,000 <strong>lao động nữ. </strong></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MrkWdEekjoVrbsxpFnQljNi6g8d\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 2:</strong> Trong suốt giai đoạn khảo s&aacute;t, <strong>tổng lực lượng lao động</strong> trong ng&agrave;nh n&agrave;y giảm mạnh, chỉ c&ograve;n gần 39,000 người v&agrave;o năm 1901, chỉ bằng khoảng một phần ba so với con số ban đầu.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HbyndapT0oCYRAxh7oSlsgO3gsf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 3: </strong>Sự sụt giảm n&agrave;y ảnh hưởng đến cả hai giới t&iacute;nh, với <strong>lao động nữ</strong> giảm xuống c&ograve;n hơn 25,000 người v&agrave;o năm cuối, trong khi số liệu của<strong> lao động nam</strong> giảm mạnh hơn xuống c&ograve;n 13,000 người v&agrave;o năm 1901, mặc d&ugrave; đ&atilde; c&oacute; sự phục hồi nhẹ v&agrave;o năm 1891.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GIRldqsZ6ogHMyxvnugl8qh7gnf\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UJDFdhw9UotrK4xsRLyldRSLgLe\">\n<div>\n<h4><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2: Số lượng nh&agrave; m&aacute;y dệt</strong></span></h4>\n<div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DuvRddOvcoqAQcxESoZl1RQPg5b\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 1:</strong> V&agrave;o đầu thời kỳ, chỉ c&oacute; 272 <strong>nh&agrave; m&aacute;y</strong><strong> dệt (factories).</strong></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RL6Ldmn8IodrSKxYlqclfuXYgOc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 2:</strong> Tuy nhi&ecirc;n, trong thập kỷ tiếp theo, <strong>số lượng nh&agrave; m&aacute;y</strong> tăng gấp ba lần, đạt đỉnh 761 địa điểm v&agrave;o năm 1861. Sau đ&oacute;,<strong> số lượng nh&agrave; m&aacute;y</strong> dần giảm trong bốn thập kỷ tiếp theo c&ograve;n 623 nh&agrave; m&aacute;y ở năm 1901.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FzcsdRMXSoU9ngxhPmbljcEIgZf\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Paraphrasing &amp; Vocabulary:</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GLbhdbCKwovei2xJSsEld7p6gXg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RPvMdqRXDoplk8xtrh1lYqWGgrg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-F2Vtd4Bh5o78qrxglSlljNPXgRh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div>\n<div>Ở b&agrave;i n&agrave;y c&aacute;c từ cần paraphrase nhiều l&agrave;: số nh&acirc;n vi&ecirc;n <strong>(the number of employees)</strong> v&agrave; nh&agrave; m&aacute;y<strong> (factories)</strong>:</div>\n<div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PuPcdxXduoUFkoxUvI8l2bmpgw3\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>the number of employees:</strong> the workforce || the labour force || employment levels || the total workforce</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Pf3LdYGrTon3fzxpfFilxk5wgdc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>factories:</strong> silk-processing facilities || production sites || locations</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TfgDd56UTo4BCVxI98tlHBnkgKc\">\n<div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Một số c&aacute;c từ vựng nổi bật:</div>\n<div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SY9hdCzRqoaH4pxo6yUlbffogQh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>undergo a consistent reduction:</strong><strong> </strong>trải qua sự giảm dần v&agrave; đều</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Hh30dmnx4onU7CxQIjVlpBZtgmg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>an initial boom in [sth]: </strong>sự tăng mạnh ban đầu của [hạng mục]</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NME8dENVzoMIRMxMNhilBL0Wgug\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>maintain higher female representation:</strong> c&oacute; nhiều nữ hơn</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-B3Y1dDBI0o1CwHxLMcflVcWvgff\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>the initial figure: </strong>số liệu ở năm đầu</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EEwpdJn5AopIpyxoPQSlQnsPgT1\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>experience a slight recovery: </strong>trải qua sự phục hồi nhỏ</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 821,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction ",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div>The table illustrates the changes, by decade, in the number of male and female workers in the silk industry of England and Wales, along with the number of factories, from 1851 to 1901.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 14722,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 822,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Overview",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div>Overall, despite the fact that the silk industry underwent a consistent reduction in the workforce across both genders, there was an initial boom in the number of factories, followed by a slight decline over time. In addition, the sector maintained higher female representation throughout the period, with women consistently outnumbering men.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 14722,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 823,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div>With regard to the labour force, in 1851, employment was at its highest level, at nearly 131,000 people, comprising roughly 54,000 males and 77,000 females. Over the surveyed period, the total workforce in this sector significantly declined, falling to just under 39,000 workers by 1901, roughly a third of the initial figure. The decline affected both genders, with female employment levels decreasing sharply to just over 25,000 in the final year, while males&rsquo; figures had fallen more dramatically to 13,000 by 1901, despite experiencing a slight recovery in 1891.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 14722,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 824,
